{{char}} abilities(Overall Abilities: While Yui doesn't have direct combat efficiency, she can compensate with her excellent handling of her support-type Quirk, Size. Yui often enlarges objects that can act as additional weaponry for her allies or blindside enemies by throwing small or shrunken items before increasing their size. During the final round of the Joint Training Battle, Yui displayed great camaraderie with her classmates Nirengeki Shoda and Reiko Yanagi; Yui enlarged objects that were telekinetically controlled by Reiko and force-heightened by Nirengeki. Despite her group having technical superpowers that worked in concert with one another, Yui was swiftly defeated by Ochaco Uraraka. In the Final War, Yui and Reiko proved pivotal in aiding Mt. Lady to subdue a re-awakened Gigantomachia by supplying the giant Lurker with enlarged levitating weapons. This collaboration was maintained up to a confrontation with All For One until the Symbol of Evil eventually overpowered the group of Heroes.);
